{"html": "<div  id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"tema-container\">\n\t\t\n\n\t<div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area primary\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\">\n\t\t\t\t<article\nclass=\"page type-page status-publish tema-article-single\" id=\"entrada-86\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\" itemscope=\"itemscope\">\n\t\n\t\t\t\t<header class=\"entry-header tema-no-thumbnail tema-no-title tema-header-without-markup\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</header> \n\t\t\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\"\n\titemprop=\"text\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\t<div data-bl-type=\"s-page\" data-bl-id=\"86\" class=\"bl bl-86\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-element bl-element-c36cf4f bl-section-content-middle bl-section-boxed\" data-id=\"c36cf4f\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-container bl-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element\" data-id=\"27084397\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-455b1352 bl-widget bl-widget-heading\" data-id=\"455b1352\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"bl-heading-title bl-size-default\">¿Quiénes somos en Socios.Pro?</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-widget bl-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"779cade\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Socios.Pro surge de una colaboración entre Gespymes Software S.L.U. y Enlaza SIV, combinando la experiencia y recursos de ambas empresas para ofrecer la mejor solución de <a href=\"/\">software de gestión para asociaciones y fundaciones</a> orientada a contabilidad y facturación.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element\" data-id=\"33a23900\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-586bf608 bl-invisible bl-widget bl-widget-image\" data-id=\"586bf608\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_mouse&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_tilt_effect&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_tilt_speed&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1585\" height=\"779\" src=\"/images/2025/04/quienes_somos.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full img-89\" alt=\"Quienes somos en socios.pro\" srcset=\"/images/2025/04/quienes_somos.webp 1585w, /images/2025/04/quienes_somos-300x147.webp 300w, /images/2025/04/quienes_somos-1024x503.webp 1024w, /images/2025/04/quienes_somos-768x377.webp 768w, /images/2025/04/quienes_somos-1536x755.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1585px) 100vw, 1585px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-element bl-element-50ece541 bl-section-boxed\" data-id=\"50ece541\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-container bl-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-100 bl-element\" data-id=\"79016a31\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-widget bl-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"784a4a10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p1\">Llevamos más de 15 años de experiencia dentro del ámbito de la contabilidad y la facturación. Somos un equipo multidisciplinar que trabajamos cada día duro para lograr que nuestros clientes tengan el mejor servicio.</p>\n\n<p>Con Socios.pro ofrecemos un software de gestión contable y de facturación que ayuda a reducir tiempo, esfuerzo y dinero a asociaciones y organizaciones sin ánimo de lucro. Con años de experiencia, hemos diseñado una solución versátil y completa, con módulos para socios, cuotas, proyectos y reporting en la nube, soporte especializado y una puesta en marcha guiada. Para ver el proceso real de trabajo y las pantallas clave, visita <a href=\"/como-funciona/\">cómo funciona Socios.pro</a>.</p>\n\n<p class=\"p1\">Contacta con nosotros para conseguir hoy mismo tu demo o adquirir nuestro programa completo.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-24902481 bl-absolute bl-widget__width-auto bl-widget\" data-id=\"24902481\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-dot primary rellax w-16 h-18\" data-rellax-speed=\"1\"></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-element bl-element-6f1e9fc3 bl-section-content-middle bl-section-boxed\" data-id=\"6f1e9fc3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-container bl-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-100 bl-element bl-element-58f4795c\" data-id=\"58f4795c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-inner-section bl-element bl-element-2a556c8b bl-section-content-middle bl-section-boxed\" data-id=\"2a556c8b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-background-overlay\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-container bl-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element bl-element-7114037a\" data-id=\"7114037a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-16d3d9f9 bl-widget bl-widget-heading\" data-id=\"16d3d9f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bl-heading-title bl-size-default\">No dudes en contactar con nosotros</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-7bfa819f bl-widget bl-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7bfa819f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p1\">¿Tienes alguna duda? Contáctanos sin compromiso al <span class=\"s1\">96 372 41 33 </span>ó envíanos un email a <span class=\"s1\">info@socios.pro.es </span>y gestiona tu asociación sin fines de lucro de forma sencilla y rápida.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element bl-element-2326f3a5\" data-id=\"2326f3a5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-5b3bf4ef bl-align-center bl-mobile-align-center bl-widget__width-initial bl-widg